1
00:00:22,719 --> 00:00:23,399
Hey, Ningle.

2
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:25,399
We're sure Wang Wenhao was in that car.

3
00:00:25,640 --> 00:00:27,879
He's at the human experiment factory now.

4
00:00:30,039 --> 00:00:32,000
Could he be luring us there on purpose?

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:33,200
Ningle, call the police first.

6
00:00:33,520 --> 00:00:34,560
Gu Yuan and I are heading there now.

7
00:00:34,799 --> 00:00:35,200
Let's go.

8
00:00:54,079 --> 00:00:54,799
Wang Wenhao

9
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:58,280
Ren Feifan and Gu Yuan
won't let you leave the country.

10
00:00:59,240 --> 00:01:00,640
Otherwise, the Gu Family will impose

11
00:01:00,640 --> 00:01:01,799
economic sanctions on my family.

12
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:03,719
This time,

13
00:01:05,079 --> 00:01:06,280
there's really nothing I can do for you.

14
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:08,599
Sinai, don't you forget.

15
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:13,719
Hello.

16
00:01:13,719 --> 00:01:15,840
The number you dialed is busy.

17
00:01:22,319 --> 00:01:23,879
The number you dialed is powered off.

18
00:01:23,879 --> 00:01:25,439
Please try again later.

19
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:32,319
Ren Feifan.

20
00:01:33,599 --> 00:01:35,079
If you want me dead,

21
00:01:36,079 --> 00:01:37,519
I'll take you down with me.

22
00:02:48,879 --> 00:02:49,759
Ren Feifan

23
00:02:50,479 --> 00:02:51,879
You sure took your sweet time.

24
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:54,919
Wang Wenhao

25
00:02:55,919 --> 00:02:57,000
You've got nowhere left to run.

26
00:02:57,800 --> 00:02:58,719
I've already called the police.

27
00:03:01,639 --> 00:03:04,080
Ren Feifan, you're such a coward!

28
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:06,120
Hiding here, waiting for the cops?

29
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:09,360
If you've got guts,
come out and fight me one-on-one!

30
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:10,879
Do you dare?

31
00:03:13,919 --> 00:03:14,719
Ren Feifan!

32
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:17,039
Come out here!

33
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:46,960
Ren Feifan

34
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:51,000
We all grew up together,

35
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:54,360
but I never took any of you seriously.

36
00:03:55,919 --> 00:03:57,360
Since I was a kid, I've known

37
00:03:58,240 --> 00:04:01,919
North City would eventually belong to me,
Wang Wenhao.

38
00:04:03,639 --> 00:04:06,520
And you'd only have two fates:

39
00:04:07,439 --> 00:04:07,960
First,

40
00:04:08,919 --> 00:04:10,479
be my lackeys.

41
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:12,080
Second,

42
00:04:13,319 --> 00:04:14,960
die by my hands.

43
00:04:19,920 --> 00:04:22,199
But I, Wang Wenhao, never imagined

44
00:04:24,199 --> 00:04:26,439
I'd be defeated by a woman.

45
00:04:27,519 --> 00:04:29,160
You weren't defeated by a woman.

46
00:04:30,720 --> 00:04:32,439
You were defeated by your own hands.

47
00:04:35,680 --> 00:04:36,199
Fine.

48
00:04:37,839 --> 00:04:38,680
Since you put it that way,

49
00:04:39,839 --> 00:04:41,279
then let's have a showdown.

50
00:04:43,920 --> 00:04:46,040
A showdown between men.

51
00:04:47,040 --> 00:04:48,079
Cut the drama.

52
00:04:51,439 --> 00:04:52,240
So what if it's two on one?

53
00:04:54,480 --> 00:04:54,959
Come at me, both of you!

54
00:04:56,319 --> 00:04:57,519
Let's make it two on one then.

55
00:04:58,240 --> 00:04:58,839
Come on!

56
00:04:59,839 --> 00:05:00,199
Bring it!

57
00:06:11,759 --> 00:06:12,839
Fake my death?

58
00:06:13,360 --> 00:06:13,920
Yeah.

59
00:06:15,519 --> 00:06:16,399
Have him fake his death.

60
00:06:17,759 --> 00:06:19,519
What's the big deal?

61
00:06:19,519 --> 00:06:20,360
Sit, sit, sit down.

62
00:06:23,079 --> 00:06:24,519
Listen to me.

63
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:27,639
Ruo Jin's dissociative identity disorder,

64
00:06:27,639 --> 00:06:30,279
it stems from the traumatic stress
four years ago.

65
00:06:31,319 --> 00:06:33,720
We need to recreate the same scenario,

66
00:06:33,879 --> 00:06:36,680
to give her the same intense shock again.

67
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:37,920
Fight poison with poison.

68
00:06:38,319 --> 00:06:42,439
Then we give her the chance to save you.

69
00:06:43,120 --> 00:06:45,639
That way, it counts as her atonement.

70
00:06:46,680 --> 00:06:49,319
Guilt and grievances cancel out,
and her trauma is resolved.

71
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:50,639
Only then is it possible

72
00:06:50,639 --> 00:06:53,079
to pull her out of her split personality.

73
00:06:55,480 --> 00:06:58,000
Jiang Ningle,
will this lousy idea even work?

74
00:06:58,519 --> 00:06:59,560
Don't end up failing to save one,

75
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:00,399
and dragging the other down too.

76
00:07:00,399 --> 00:07:01,399
Oh, just shut up.

77
00:07:03,360 --> 00:07:05,040
It's called Cognitive Behavioral Therapy.

78
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:07,839
It helps patients
correct cognitive distortions.

79
00:07:09,279 --> 00:07:11,319
If you think it works, then let's do it.

80
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:13,480
As long as it helps Ruo Jin recover,

81
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:15,399
I'm willing to take any risk.

82
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:29,480
Are you insane?

83
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:30,800
Are you crazy?

84
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:33,639
I've got a condition,
I'm afraid of heights, man!

85
00:07:33,639 --> 00:07:34,720
You're afraid of heights
and you brought me here?

86
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:36,639
Well, duh, isn't it for the act?

87
00:07:36,639 --> 00:07:37,879
It's only the third floor
and you're terrified.

88
00:07:37,879 --> 00:07:39,639
Any higher and I'd be on my knees.

89
00:07:40,040 --> 00:07:41,639
No wonder you didn't take me up higher.

90
00:07:42,560 --> 00:07:43,800
Are you guys even reliable?

91
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:44,639
Where's Gu Yuan?

92
00:07:45,079 --> 00:07:46,600
You don't trust me?

93
00:07:47,079 --> 00:07:49,639
What's the rush?
Let poor Gu Yuan act a bit more.

94
00:07:49,639 --> 00:07:50,800
It's not our turn yet.

95
00:07:53,279 --> 00:07:54,519
What a sin.

96
00:07:55,720 --> 00:07:57,040
Ruo Jin, come with me.

97
00:07:59,680 --> 00:08:00,399
What are you doing?

98
00:08:00,839 --> 00:08:02,759
Jiang Ningle and Ren Feifan
are having an affair at a hotel.

99
00:08:03,279 --> 00:08:04,079
Come catch them in the act with me.

100
00:08:04,680 --> 00:08:06,439
Gu Yuan, don't joke like that.

101
00:08:06,480 --> 00:08:07,600
It's not funny at all.

102
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:12,279
It's true.

103
00:08:13,519 --> 00:08:14,279
Let me tell you.

104
00:08:15,040 --> 00:08:16,399
Back in college, this Jiang Ningle

105
00:08:16,399 --> 00:08:17,680
already had a secret crush on Feifan.

106
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:20,079
Feifan didn't get a single visit request
from you for four years!

107
00:08:20,079 --> 00:08:21,360
and it was all Jiang Ningle's doing.

108
00:08:22,839 --> 00:08:24,839
Impossible. Absolutely impossible.

109
00:08:25,759 --> 00:08:26,399
You're lying to me.

110
00:08:28,399 --> 00:08:29,800
Come on, just come with me!

111
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:30,800
Let's go, let's go!

112
00:08:34,399 --> 00:08:35,240
They're coming, they're coming!

113
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:36,120
Hurry up and tie me up!

114
00:08:36,120 --> 00:08:36,799
I'm on it, I'm on it!

115
00:08:36,799 --> 00:08:37,480
They're here, they're here!

116
00:08:37,480 --> 00:08:38,080
Go, go, go!

117
00:08:39,480 --> 00:08:39,919
Hold it up!

118
00:08:41,320 --> 00:08:42,039
Hold it where?

119
00:08:42,039 --> 00:08:42,639
Here, here, here!

120
00:08:45,440 --> 00:08:46,039
Ruo Jin!

121
00:08:46,039 --> 00:08:46,600
Feifan!

122
00:08:49,759 --> 00:08:51,919
Four years ago, why didn't you save us?

123
00:08:51,919 --> 00:08:53,399
Why didn't you save my parents?

124
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:54,919
Aren't you a doctor?

125
00:08:55,399 --> 00:08:56,919
Aren't your medical skills unmatched?

126
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:58,480
Why didn't you save us?

127
00:08:58,480 --> 00:08:59,759
Ningle, Ningle!

128
00:09:01,639 --> 00:09:02,519
Just calm down.

129
00:09:03,159 --> 00:09:03,879
Calm down!

130
00:09:04,240 --> 00:09:06,320
Ruo Jin, don't come any closer! Run!

131
00:09:08,279 --> 00:09:09,440
Okay, okay.

132
00:09:10,639 --> 00:09:13,919
That day four years ago,
you clearly saw us.

133
00:09:13,919 --> 00:09:15,639
I kept calling out to you,

134
00:09:15,639 --> 00:09:17,360
but you did absolutely nothing.

135
00:09:18,039 --> 00:09:19,360
Aren't you a doctor?

136
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:21,639
Where's your healer's heart?

137
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:25,639
Why do you get a cozy family life now?

138
00:09:25,639 --> 00:09:26,240
Ningle!

139
00:09:26,919 --> 00:09:27,720
Ningle!

140
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:29,799
Listen to me.

141
00:09:31,639 --> 00:09:32,840
Four years ago,

142
00:09:33,679 --> 00:09:34,759
four years ago, it was...

143
00:09:35,639 --> 00:09:36,679
It was Wang Wenhao.

144
00:09:37,639 --> 00:09:40,399
Wang Wenhao wanted to harm Feifan
and his family.

145
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:41,639
You know this.

146
00:09:42,480 --> 00:09:43,960
If you want to blame someone, blame me.

147
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:45,639
Let Feifan go.

148
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:46,840
Take me instead, okay?

149
00:09:46,840 --> 00:09:47,360
Stay back!

150
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:47,919
Ruo Jin!

151
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:48,960
Don't come any closer!

152
00:09:49,320 --> 00:09:51,120
In your dreams! Go to hell!

153
00:09:52,240 --> 00:09:53,240
Feifan!

154
00:09:54,320 --> 00:09:55,159
Feifan!

155
00:09:56,720 --> 00:09:58,759
Feifan, I've got you!

156
00:09:59,600 --> 00:10:01,279
Ruo Jin, you caught me.

157
00:10:01,440 --> 00:10:02,480
You saved me.

158
00:10:03,320 --> 00:10:04,200
I've got you.

159
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:16,200
Ruo Jin, you caught me.

160
00:10:16,279 --> 00:10:17,320
You saved me.

161
00:10:17,639 --> 00:10:19,279
It's okay. It's all over now.

162
00:10:28,879 --> 00:10:30,720
It's okay. It's all over now.

163
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:32,919
That scared the hell out of me!

164
00:10:32,919 --> 00:10:34,519
I'm afraid of heights, you know!

165
00:10:34,799 --> 00:10:37,600
I'll never do this job again,
no matter what!

166
00:10:37,600 --> 00:10:38,759
You acted really well.

167
00:10:39,159 --> 00:10:39,799
Of course.

168
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:40,639
Of course.

169
00:10:40,639 --> 00:10:41,559
I almost believed it myself.

170
00:10:41,559 --> 00:10:42,240
Naturally.

171
00:10:45,519 --> 00:10:46,200
Ruo Jin.

172
00:10:47,639 --> 00:10:48,240
It's okay now.

173
00:10:52,960 --> 00:10:55,399
Ugh, the stench of romance in the air.
